# Integer random walk
# Source: Tail Probabilities for Randomized Program Runtimes via Martingales for Higher Moments (2019), Appendix E, Listing 1.3, PDF p.35
# URL: https://arxiv.org/pdf/1811.06779v2
# Independently normalized pseudocode; NOT a native input file for any baseline tool.
# C is a ghost counter: one increment per loop-body execution; not CFG runtime.

x := 1;
C := 0;
while x >= 1 do
    C := C + 1;
    if prob(0.6) then
        x := x - 1
    else
        x := x + 1
    fi
od
